@startuml
[*] --> LoggedOut
LoggedOut --> AccountCreation : CreateAccount
AccountCreation --> LoggedIn : AccountCreated
LoggedOut --> Login : LoginAttempt
Login : LoginSuccess
Login --> LoggedIn : LoginSuccess
LoggedIn --> VisaApplication : ApplyVisa
VisaApplication --> PaymentReceived : PaymentMade
PaymentReceived --> ApplicationAccepted : ApplicationAccepted
LoggedIn --> ViewStatus : CheckStatus
ViewStatus --> StatusChecked : StatusChecked
LoggedIn --> CancelApplication : CancelApplication
CancelApplication --> LoggedIn : ApplicationCancelled
LoggedIn --> ModifyDetails : ModifyDetails
ModifyDetails --> LoggedIn : DetailsModified
LoggedIn --> ViewDetails : ViewDetails
ViewDetails --> LoggedIn : DetailsViewed
LoggedIn --> ViewPurpose : ViewPurpose
ViewPurpose --> DocumentCheck : DocumentCheck
DocumentCheck --> VisaApproved : VisaApproved
DocumentCheck --> VisaRejected : VisaRejected
VisaApproved --> StatusUpdated : StatusUpdated
VisaRejected --> StatusUpdated : StatusUpdated
StatusUpdated --> Feedback : FeedbackGiven
Feedback --> LoggedIn : FeedbackSubmitted
LoggedIn --> Logout : LogoutRequest
Logout --> LoggedOut : LogoutSuccess
@enduml
